---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import ContactForm from "../components/ContactForm.astro";
import { BOOKING_URL, EMAIL } from "../site";
import portrait from "../../content/images/IMG_9454.jpg";
---

<Base
  title="About Alexis | Water's Edge Massage Therapy"
  description="Alexis Penner is a Registered Massage Therapist with over 10 years of experience."
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="About" title="About Alexis" />

  <section class="bio container section">
    <Image
      class="bio__photo"
      src={portrait}
      alt="Alexis Penner, Registered Massage Therapist, smiling in a brown knit sweater"
      widths={[480, 760, 1100]}
      sizes="(max-width: 860px) 100vw, 40vw"
      loading="eager"
    />
    <div class="bio__copy">
      <p class="lead">
        Since 2015, Alexis has been a dedicated Registered Massage Therapist, blending scientific knowledge with an
        intuitive and compassionate approach to deliver personalized, therapeutic care. She recognizes the deep
        connection between physical and mental well-being and creates a safe, supportive space for healing.
      </p>
      <p>
        Believing that every person is unique, Alexis tailors each treatment to individual needs, emphasizing patient
        education and self-awareness as key components of recovery. She has an innate ability to meet people where
        they are, allowing her to connect with authenticity and adapt her treatments to support each person’s goals,
        comfort, and capacity. Alexis remains committed to ongoing learning, with a focus on holistic and
        evidence-informed approaches that empower lasting change.
      </p>
      <p>
        Her passion for healing is deeply personal, shaped by her own experiences recovering from injuries, including
        a serious car accident and the physical demands of an active lifestyle. Through manual therapy, home care, and
        strength training, she helps patients move toward their most functional, pain-free selves.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside the clinic, Alexis finds balance in nature with trail running, gravel and mountain biking, and
        spending time with her dog. North Vancouver’s natural beauty and active lifestyle inspire her daily, and she
        is grateful to call it home.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="reach section" aria-labelledby="reach-title">
    <div class="container reach__grid">
      <div>
        <h2 id="reach-title">Have Questions or Want to Book a Massage?</h2>
        <p>
          I’d love to hear from you. Feel free to reach out using the form below or email me directly. I’ll get back
          to you within 1–2 business days.
        </p>
        <p class="signoff">
          Looking forward to connecting,<br />
          <span class="signoff__name">Alexis</span><br />
          <em>Registered Massage Therapist</em>
        </p>
        <p class="reach__links">
          <a class="button" href={BOOKING_URL}>Book now</a>
          <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <ContactForm submit="Submit" />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .bio {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 5fr 7fr;
    gap: 3rem clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .bio__photo {
    position: sticky;
    top: 7rem;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
  .bio__copy {
    max-width: 38rem;
  }
  .bio__copy p {
    margin: 0 0 1.5em;
  }
  .bio__copy .lead {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.625rem, 2.6vw, 2.25rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--cedar);
    margin-bottom: 1.5em;
  }

  .reach {
    background: var(--sand);
  }
  .reach__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 6fr 5fr;
    gap: 3rem clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem);
  }
  .reach h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    color: var(--cedar);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    max-width: 14ch;
  }
  .reach p {
    max-width: 30rem;
  }
  .signoff {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .signoff__name {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    color: var(--cedar);
  }
  .reach__links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem 2rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .bio,
    .reach__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .bio__photo {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
